+
+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+A client MAY request summaries of the conversations belonging to the authenticated user on this connection. The server answers with a `conversation_list` frame containing summary metadata with ISO string timestamps, and derives the user id from the authenticated connection rather than the request frame ([validated by: answers an authenticated socket with its own conversation summaries over the wire](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
